  lines:
  - speaker: Carrot
    portrait: {fileID: -2542069593327755888, guid: 29e714b37c6a8d641ab6bbe176e2eedf, type: 3}
    text: RAWWRRRRRRRRRRRRRRRR !!
  - speaker: Edmund Chamar
    portrait: {fileID: -984164299818982976, guid: 1caf50aa47e18214b94fb3ee8bee0004, type: 3}
    text: 'Woah whaahhat nd who are you ?

'
  - speaker: Maa Muli
    portrait: {fileID: -2542069593327755888, guid: 29e714b37c6a8d641ab6bbe176e2eedf, type: 3}
    text: Orewa MAA MULI desu (*i am <i>maa muli</i>)
  - speaker: Edmund Chamar
    portrait: {fileID: -984164299818982976, guid: 1caf50aa47e18214b94fb3ee8bee0004, type: 3}
    text: But you are neither Muli nor a Maa that doesn't make sense T~T
  - speaker: Maa Muli
    portrait: {fileID: -2542069593327755888, guid: 29e714b37c6a8d641ab6bbe176e2eedf, type: 3}
    text: "Yes but that's the limit of our dev's creativity (-\u03C9-;)"
  - speaker: Edmund Chamar
    portrait: {fileID: -984164299818982976, guid: 1caf50aa47e18214b94fb3ee8bee0004, type: 3}
    text: Ehh can't argue on that, anyhow are you here for the game's plot twist?
  - speaker: Maa Muli
    portrait: {fileID: -2542069593327755888, guid: 29e714b37c6a8d641ab6bbe176e2eedf, type: 3}
    text: Nehh idc about that, I'ma just leave yer sorry ahh alone
  - speaker: Edmund Chamar
    portrait: {fileID: -984164299818982976, guid: 1caf50aa47e18214b94fb3ee8bee0004, type: 3}
    text: ...
